        "eyebrow": "Our vision",
        "heading": "Making India water positive",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Scale-O was founded in 2022 to give Indian homes a salt-free way to deal with hard water. We design compact softeners for overhead tanks so houses, villas and bungalows can reduce scaling without wasting salt, water or electricity.</p><p>Every product is built to keep minerals in the water, protect fittings and appliances, and stay simple to install. From Mini to Centi, the same idea holds: treat water at the tank, then use it as usual through the home.</p>",
