        "eyebrow": "Our founder",
        "heading": "Mr. Prasham Mehta",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Prasham Mehta is the founder of Scale-O. He is an environmental engineer with more than 10 years in water treatment, and he started Scale-O to solve hard-water scaling in a way that is easier on homes and the environment.</p><p>After graduating from L.D. College of Engineering, Ahmedabad in 2014, he worked with Passavant Energy on a water-treatment project for Ford Motors India in Sanand, Gujarat. He later moved through marketing, proposals and sales, and became Business Development Director at Advent Envirocare Technology Pvt. Ltd.</p><p>That mix of engineering, project work and commercial experience led to Scale-O: a salt-free softener that sits in the overhead tank and does not need salt, electricity or regular servicing.</p>",
        "show_button": false,
        "button_label": "",
        "button_url": "",
