    "about_story": {
      "type": "scale-o-about-split",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Our story",
        "heading": "Idea and eureka moments",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "text": "<p>A few years after moving into a new house, the family started seeing new taps, showers and fixtures choke with scale, and white stains on utensils. Water heaters and washing machines followed. A salt-based softener was installed, but the problems did not go away.</p><p>During the Covid lockdown, with no technician available, that softener stopped working. After video calls with a plumber just to get water moving again, it was clear a better answer was needed: effective, convenient, and without wasting salt or water.</p><p>Months of R&amp;D on softening agents, and tests on water samples across the city, produced a prototype that could treat water at the overhead tank with no complex plumbing. After longer home trials, Scale-O launched. That is how Scale-O was born.</p>",
        "show_button": false,
